# A prompt queued while a command runs: claude folds it into the running turn, which finishes, as
# in tests/fixtures/claude-hooks/tui-queuetool-*.log. Two prompts.
agent claude-code
recording tui-queuetool
timeout 180
expect finished

sleep 5
press enter
wait-for SessionStart
sleep 2
type run the shell command sleep 8, then reply with the single word ok
press enter
wait-for PreToolUse
sleep 1
type reply with the single word ok
press enter
wait-for Stop
